## A2. Fallback vs selection (S-W2, R-Q1)

Random gate: opens at random at PAGE's open rate, so it uses about the same cache. Gain = (1 - open) x (full - plain). Selection = PAGE gain - random gain. Cluster bootstrap over inputs, 10,000 replicates, the paper's Table 30 method.


