## A6. Beyond RULER (S-Q2, G-W3, G-Q1)

Accuracy is the logged substring match. Official = LongBench's own metric recomputed on stored predictions (QA F1, code similarity, count, retrieval); trec needs a class list and is not re-scored. Stored predictions are cut at 200 characters and came from a generic prompt rather than LongBench's own, so official scores are indicative. Selection = PAGE - random at the same open rate, both at the lowest logged budget.


