## A7. Task-level ceiling (corrects `main.tex:326`, `appendix_content.tex:798-800`)

Whole-task policy: closes whole tasks in order of benefit, using labels and hindsight, until it reaches PAGE's closed fraction, taking the expected value of a partial last task. Out-of-sample version: tasks are ordered on one half of the inputs and evaluated on the other.


